{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06629","headline":"巩城南河作寄徐三景晖 · 储光羲","name":"巩城南河作寄徐三景晖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初年雨候迟，巩洛河流小。\n摇摇芳草岸，屡见春山晓。\n清露洗云林，轻波戏鱼鸟。\n唯言故人远，不念乡川眇。\n舟檝去潆廻，湍漵行奔峭。\n寄书千里路，莫道南鸿少。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}